SCOPE

This licence covers the ANALYSIS CODE in this repository only.

It does not cover, and cannot grant any rights in, the survey microdata the
code reads. The NFHS/DHS, ACCESS, IRES and NSS 78th-round datasets remain
governed by the terms of their original providers, none of them are
redistributed here, and each must be obtained from its own source under its own
conditions. See "Data access" in README.md.

DISTRICT BOUNDARIES

app/data/districts.geojson is derived from the SHRUG 2011 Census district
polygons (Development Data Lab; Asher S, Lunt T, Matsuura R, Novosad P.
World Bank Economic Review 35(4):845-871, 2021), simplified and reprojected.
It is NOT covered by the ISC licence above: like its source, it is licensed
under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
(CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/). The
pc11_d_id column of data/district_lpg_estimates.csv is an identifier for
joining to those polygons and carries no geometry.
